{
  "id": "ZEC.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "ZEC",
  "reference": "Sekaria 14",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Boriet ne baregei Jerusalem ak bororiosiek",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeero, nyonei betutab Jehovah, ye tun kipcheei baruneniguk eng’ kwenung’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu tun ayumi bororiosiek tugul kobokyi Jerusalem kobargei; ak kenam nganaset, ak keluul gorik, ak kesuub kwonyik: ak kimut kebebertab nganaset koek luulenik, ama kibarei bik che kang’et eng’ nganaset. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo kwo Jehovah, kwo kobargei ak bororiosiechoto, ko u ye kiyaei boriet eng’ betutab luget. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak tun tononie kelyekyik eng’ betunoto tulwetab Emitik, ne mi taitab Jerusalem eng’ komostab kong’asis, ak kobetak kwenutab tulwetab Emitik ole tokyingei kong’asis ak cherongo, ak kobiit eng’ yoto atebwet ne o; ak kwo kebebertab tulwonoto kotokyingei murot ne bo katam, ak kwo kebeberta age kotokyigei murot ne bo tai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak omwei obun atebwetab tulonokyuk; amu itei atebwetab tulonok Asel: ee, omwei, ko u ye kiomwei ye kibotani ng’ony eng’ betusiekab Usia laitoriatab Juda: ak konyo Jehovah Kamuktaindennyu, komi bik tugul che tililen koboto inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak mailuu lapkeiyet eng’ betunoto amaimenitu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ago betut agenge ne naat eng’ Jehovah; ma bet, ama kemoi: ago lapkeitu koskoleny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak tun mong’une beek che soptos Jerusalem eng’ betunoto; bendi kebeberta age kotokyingei nyanjet ne mi kong’asis, kobendi kebeberta age kotokyingei nyanjet ne mi cherongo: bendi ko u noto eng’ kemei ak iwot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Katerteretab Jehovah ak laitornatennyi eng’ony komugul",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak koek Jehovah laitoriatab ng’ony komugul: egu agenge Jehovah eng’ betunoto, ak koek agenge kainennyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwalei emet tugul koigei Araba, koboch Geba agoi Rimon murot ne bo tai ne bo Jerusalem; ak kieeti, ak komeny oldanyi, koboch ormarichetab Benjamin, agoi komostab ormarichet ne bo tai, agoi ormarichetab luita, koboch teekset ne koi ne bo Hananel, agoi komoswekab laitoriat ole kitue sabibuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak komeny bik oloto, ama komi chubisiet kogeny; ago meng’isiei Jerusalem eng’ chametab ge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak biitu koroitab ng’ony ne bire Jehovah bik tugul che kibargei ak Jerusalem: nundos borwekwak kota kotonondos, ak konunio konyekwak eng’ kelongonikwak, ak konunio ng’elyebwekwak eng’ kutuswekwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bunu Jehovah eng’ betunoto wasetab ge ne o, ne nyonei kwenunywa; ak konam age tugul eng’ ichek eutab chitab kokwennyi, ak kobargei inendet ak chitab kokwennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kobargei Juda agine ak Jerusalem; ak kiyomo magornatosiek che bo bororiosiek tugul, che mi komoswek tugul, tahabu, feda, ak ngoroik, eng’ chang’indo ne o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak biitu ko u noto, koroito ne bo mbartanyit, ak ne bo nyumbut, ak ne bo tambesiet, ak ne bo sigiriet, ak ne bo tiong’ik tugul che mitei meng’otosiechoto, ko u koroiyoto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak age tugul ne ng’etu eng’ bororiosiek tugul che kiibokyin Jerusalem, kotogostoi oloto eng’ kenyit age tugul, kolosu Laitoriat, Jehovah ne bo lugosiek, ak koyai igorta ne bo keriosiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak age tugul ne bo ortinwek tugul che bo ng’ony ne matogostoi Jerusalem kolosu Laitoriat, Jehovah ne bo lugosiek, ko manyoru choto ropta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ngot ko matogosta oretab gotab Misri, amabwa, ko marobonjin agichek; biitu koroito ne bire Jehovah bororiosiek che matogosta koba koyai igorta ne bo keriosiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egu nito biretab Misri, ak biretab bororiosiek tugul che matogosta koba igorta ne bo keriosiek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tun kisirjin eng’ betunoto chepchingilokab mbartanyisiek kole, TILIL ENG’ JEHOVAH; igeitu terenik che mi gotab Jehovah tabok che mi taitab kaptisisiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, kitililjin Jehovah ne bo lugosiek teret age tugul eng’ Jerusalem ak eng’ Juda; ak kobwa ichek tugul che eng’sei, koib terenichoto ak koyoise: ama komitei kogeny eng’ betunoto chemung’araindet eng’ gotab Jehovah ne bo lugosiek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "END OF BOOK",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
